{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15543","headline":"禁中春松 · 常沂","name":"禁中春松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"映殿松偏好，森森列禁中。\n攒柯沾圣泽，疎盖引皇风。\n晚色连秦苑，春香满汉宫。\n操将金石固，材与直臣同。\n翠影宜青琐，苍枝秀碧空。\n还知沐天眷，千载更葱茏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常沂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}